      "content": "Use C.L.U.E. before you answer: Check the picture, Look at the sentence, Use the tone, Eliminate dictionary-only matches.\n\nIn the ad, the chair is on the pavement beside a box of unwanted things. What has happened to that chair, and which one synonym fits that exact scene?"
    },
